silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeUngatedRenderAnchorMeasurementEvent', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The measurement-event olog node: Mittens weighed at 4.1 kg on 2024-11-01 at the vet visit. This node must be typed and validated (via SHACL shape) before the render functor produces a proof-surface figure. Without it, the figure is an ungated visual artefact.." .
